          "labelEn": "",
          "placeholder": "登录极睿个人账户 → MCP Token 管理 → 创建 Token → 名称填写 WorkBuddy",
          "placeholderEn": "Sign in to Infimind → MCP Token management → Create token → Name it WorkBuddy",
          "description": "仅填写本人账户创建的独立 Token，请勿在其他 MCP 客户端复用。",
          "descriptionEn": "Use a dedicated token created by your own account; do not reuse it in another MCP client.",
          "type": "password",
          "required": true
        }
      ]
